WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.878
NARRATOR: The social worker reassures
Dr. Osei that she is only here to help,

2
00:00:07.878 --> 00:00:10.459
that her son wants
what is best for her,

3
00:00:10.459 --> 00:00:13.944
and that the family will
work everything out together.

4
00:00:14.144 --> 00:00:14.947
DR. OSEI: I see.

5
00:00:16.147 --> 00:00:18.757
I spent thirty-four years
watching students answer

6
00:00:18.757 --> 00:00:20.689
the question they
wished I had asked.

7
00:00:20.889 --> 00:00:22.782
You have just done the same.

8
00:00:22.982 --> 00:00:26.594
I asked what you are here to decide,
and you told me my son loves me.

9
00:00:26.594 --> 00:00:29.055
Then I will tell you what I think
is happening.

10
00:00:29.055 --> 00:00:30.872
He has already chosen the
facility.

11
00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:33.146
He has had the house appraised.

12
00:00:33.346 --> 00:00:35.951
And you have been sent to make it
look like a process.

13
00:00:36.451 --> 00:00:38.147
I decline to continue this visit.

14
00:00:38.147 --> 00:00:40.993
You may tell him that I was
perfectly lucid when I said so.

15
00:00:40.993 --> 00:00:43.295
My attorney's card is on the table
by the door.

16
00:00:43.495 --> 00:00:45.206
Please take it with you.

17
00:00:47.006 --> 00:00:49.422
NARRATOR: Dr. Osei has ended the
visit.

18
00:00:49.622 --> 00:00:53.214
What did your reassurance cost,
and what do you do now?
